	(text "TCAN3413: 100 nF on VCC (C41) and VIO (C42) (SLLSFS8A 8.4).\nSTB has an internal pull-up (standby): the MCU drives it low to talk.\nTermination R21 + SW1: switch on at the first and last board only.\nJ7/J8 pin 1 CANH, 2 CANL, 3 CAN GND. R20: CAN ground pin through\n100 Ohm so it never carries chain return current. Transceiver close to J7/J8."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "274f8a31-9235-4b2d-b1b9-d4b5fe0f4449")
	)
	(text "USB-C sink only: 5.1k on CC1 / CC2, no PD. USBLC6-2SC6 and C43 1 uF (USB max 10 uF) at the connector.\nThe PC connects only through the isolated USB adapter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9ffac053-401b-4476-aba7-6e77d5258293")
	)
